 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.4-rc23 — Photos to Discord
+
+- **Also share to the UnderWeb Discord** (Command → Post to your showcase): tick it and, once staff approve the photo, it's posted to the UnderWeb Discord with your title, caption and name. Off by default; UWX remembers your choice. Nothing unreviewed ever reaches Discord.
+- If the UnderWeb server isn't set up for Discord sharing yet, the photo still goes to your showcase and UWX tells you Discord wasn't included.
+
 ## 0.6.3-rc22 — Invite safety, clearer invites, more themes
 
 - **No more accidental spam.** Turning on automatic friend or group invites now asks first and tells you exactly who it would hit right away, how many, which message, and how often. "All online friends" gets a red warning. "Invite now" for 3+ people, "Invite N to group", invite setups with the send button, and Event Mode presets that switch invites on all ask first too.
